==Trivia==
*Sunstone Valley was originally called Stormfront Mountains back in 2009.
*Sunstone Valley was the only major location addition to ''[[Free Realms]]'' in the update released on September 19, 2012.
*According to ''Free Realms'' Game Designer, Ryan Shannon in the video, Sunstone Valley is about the size of [[Briarwood]].<ref>https://youtu.be/P2K7QZVB7Sw Free Realms Sunstone Valley Part 2 -- New Features!</ref>
*Sunstone Valley's open world combat is similar in style to [[w:c:cwa:PvE|Clone Wars Adventures]].
*Sunstone Valley was the only location outside Sacred Grove where players could explore

